WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
You have nothing. You are nothing.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.480
You are wickedness. You are jealousy.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.600
You are envy. You are hatred.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.460
You are nothing. You can build nothing.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.680
You can produce nothing.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.520
You can create nothing.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:20.280
We are the ones who build. We are the ones who create.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:23.559
We are the ones who lift up humanity.

